====== Strong 1200 ======

The Strong 1200 is a simultaneous dual band WIFI router with AC1200 WiFi - 300+867 Mbps (2.4 & 5 GHz) speeds. It contains non-removable external antennas. The router features 4 Gbit LAN and one Gbit WAN port. 
It comes with a large 16 MB FLASH ROM and a quad core MIPS CPU powered by 128 MB RAM, USB port and a microSD slot.
It's sold (re)branded as "**MTC 1201**" and "**HooToo HT-ND001**", and probably under other brand names too.

**Use the MTC 1201 images to flash the Strong 1200**


